---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="section-card">
    <h1>About Tip Tap Tip</h1>
    <p>Tip Tap Tip is a podcast about technology, geek culture, and Eurovision. Join Eric and Rachelle as they discuss weird news, strange media, and the world through a uniquely irreverent lens.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-card hosts-grid">
    <article class="host-card">
      <h2>Eric</h2>
      <p>Eric has been involved in a variety of media before creating Tip Tap Tip. He was the co-editor of the Calgary-based magazine Squidmail during the 1990s and is also a co-host of <a href="http://thesaladyears.wordpress.com/">The Salad Years</a>.</p>
      <p><strong>Twitter</strong> - <a href="https://twitter.com/ericskilling">@ericskilling</a></p>
      <p><strong>Mastodon</strong> - <a href="https://mastodon.online/@ericskilling">@ericskilling@mastodon.online</a></p>
    </article>

    <article class="host-card">
      <h2>Rachelle</h2>
      <p>When she isn't busting Eric's balls on the show or encouraging him to don a leather daddy get-up, Rachelle makes art and helps raise their two young children.</p>
      <p>Rachelle's art can be found on Instagram <a href="https://instagram.com/artmom_artmom">@artmom_artmom</a> and at <a href="https://rachelleskillingart.wordpress.com">rachelleskillingart.wordpress.com</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
